Z||000012||ray b||12-24-2001||07:09 PM||||BMW are very good cars but parts are unrealy high priced like $500 for one{1] caliper or $200 to rebuild the same caliper.<BR>get a pre-smog or a after 85 car WHY? early smoged bmw used a reactor not a cat and they crack the AL heads and heads are not cheap or eazy to find used.I have cracked 3 different cars heads. DONOT BUY a grey market car [euro speck] they will not sell parts for them in USA and most shops will not work on them.<BR>SO unless you can pay the price for parts and do your own work.stay away from BMW's<BR>I have owned 1800, 1800Tii,1602 ,2002,733 and 635 alpina.still want a 3.5 cslr but know better now.<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd<p>[This message has been edited by ray b (edited 12-24-2001).]||||reg||1
